{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person  underwater explorer. Plunge into the real world horror of the ocean's dark depths. As you head down into the trench, the dark of the abyss surrounds you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark of the Depths uses realistic visuals to put you in the atmosphere of the deepest oceans. Use your torch to guide you through the darkness, avoiding violent fish and experience our fears of what lies beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a network of rusted structures in search of missing items. Recover interactive collectibles and find all the items needed to complete the game and leave the ocean floor.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382750?t=1769878079","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769878079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382750/dd2d095abfb076f72284881ab62e5354aab57b5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769878079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382750/dd2d095abfb076f72284881ab62e5354aab57b5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769878079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person  underwater explorer. Plunge into the real world horror of the ocean's dark depths. As you head down into the trench, the dark of the abyss surrounds you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark of the Depths uses realistic visuals to put you in the atmosphere of the deepest oceans. Use your torch to guide you through the darkness, avoiding violent fish and experience our fears of what lies beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a network of rusted structures in search o